pastex (1.10.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the package Description that shipped in 1.10.0. The control file is
    generated by an unquoted shell heredoc, so the backticked
    pastex --enable-permissions inside the description was run as a command
    substitution and replaced by empty output: "apt show pastex" said "and
    only" followed by "installs them.". The heredoc is now quoted and only the
    @PKG@, @VERSION@ and @ARCH@ placeholders are substituted, and the
    description no longer contains backticks or "$" at all.
  * Two tests render the generated control file and reject shell
    metacharacters in any description, and two mutation checks cover both the
    quoting and the text.

