pastex (1.8.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix one-click paste doing nothing on GNOME. The log said "window manager
    did not minimize (state=normal)", but iconify() only *asks* the compositor:
    the window is still reported as "normal" for a few milliseconds, so Pastex
    concluded the minimize had failed and copied the text without ever sending
    Ctrl+V. The state is now polled in 20 ms steps for up to 300 ms, the
    minimize request is repeated once at 120 ms for compositors that ignore
    the first one, and the <Unmap> signal still sends Ctrl+V as soon as the
